msgid ""
"Adapter key under which the inbound XML arrived (e.g. 'storecove', 'pagero',"
" 'manual'). Identifies which transport channel the message took; surfaces in"
" the audit trail. Adapter must be registered via the access_point_registry "
"before the value will roundtrip into a real submit/poll call."
msgstr ""
"Adapternyckel under vilken den inkommande XML:en anlände (t.ex. 'storecove',"
" 'pagero', 'manual'). Identifierar vilken transportkanal meddelandet tog; "
"visas i granskningsspåret. Adaptern måste vara registrerad via "
"access_point_registry innan värdet kan gå fram och tillbaka i ett verkligt "
"submit/poll-anrop."

